  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Assistance for Irregular Migrants (GAIM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports stranded migrants on their way to Canada through West Africa with assisted voluntary return and reintegration to the country of origin. Focus is on identification of migrants, screening, and humanitarian support; return and reintegration assistance to their countries of origin; and prevention activities in the form of awareness raising on the risks of irregular migration in countries of origin.</narrative>
  </description>
